      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get that, but i've heard serotonin syndrome is pretty rare and usually only happens if you're taking really high doses. im just planning on taking a single low dose to get through the night so i can sleep. isn't it probably fine just this once? it's just for the back pain and i really need the relief.",
